WEBVTT

00:00:00.653 --> 00:00:01.300
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.304 --> 00:00:04.460
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’m very stressed today.

00:00:04.789 --> 00:00:06.469
I have too much work.

00:00:08.015 --> 00:00:10.118
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> My boss talks too much.

00:00:12.226 --> 00:00:12.869
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.848 --> 00:00:15.667
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> My diet is unhealthy.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.445
I eat too many cakes and sweets.

00:00:20.413 --> 00:00:21.215
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.195 --> 00:00:23.987
<v><b>Speaker 4:</b></v> I don’t want to go out tonight.

00:00:24.244 --> 00:00:25.306
I’m too tired.